{"src":"de","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":198400,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"de","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":8608.282718999999,"text":"Im Jahr 1990 wurde es aufgrund der Bedrohung durch Wüstensand zur Liste der gefährdeten Weltkulturerbegebiete hinzugefügt."},{"kind":"text","t":8982.949577,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of endangered World Heritage sites due to the threat from desert sand."},{"kind":"audio","t":9032.325428999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9033.676026,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9035.093504999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9036.708847,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":9038.343209999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9039.870219999999,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":13921.595641,"text":"Wenn Sie den Film Das Vermächtnis der Tempelritter gesehen haben,"},{"kind":"text","t":14123.241312,"text":"If you’ve watched the movie The Templar Legacy,"},{"kind":"audio","t":14161.818217,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14163.42232,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14163.818258,"samples":15464,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":40},{"kind":"input","t":20363.850457,"text":"Denken Sie vielleicht, dass auf der Rückseite der Unabhängigkeitserklärung eine Schatzkarte gezeichnet wurde."},{"kind":"text","t":20648.396514,"text":"You might think that a treasure map was drawn on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":20691.030431000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20692.605613,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20694.190845,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20695.822277000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":20696.193385000002,"samples":12928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":32439.042308,"text":"Kinder werden aus einer Vielzahl von Gründen in Pflegefamilien untergebracht und zwar aus verschiedenen Gründen, die von Vernachlässigung über Missbrauch bis hin zur Erpressung reichen."},{"kind":"text","t":32720.654636000003,"text":"Children are placed in foster families for various reasons, ranging from neglect and abuse to coercion."},{"kind":"audio","t":32765.690891000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32767.178161,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32768.762843,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":32770.387596,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32772.023749,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32772.838574999994,"samples":20960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"input","t":42416.316463999996,"text":"Das Cochamotal Chiles wichtigstes Kletterziel, bekannt als der Yosemite National Park von Südamerika mit einer Vielzahl von großen Granitwänden und Klippen."},{"kind":"text","t":42886.558272999995,"text":"Cochamó Tal is Chile’s most important climbing destination, known as South America’s Yosemite National Park, with a multitude of large granite walls and cliffs."},{"kind":"audio","t":42938.424605,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":42939.981857,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42941.623449,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42943.283942999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42944.881884999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42946.485996999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":970},{"kind":"audio","t":42948.122189999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42949.775842999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42950.904606,"samples":27056,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":530},{"kind":"input","t":48138.831358999996,"text":"Aristoteles Ansichten zu allen Wissenschaftsfragen einschließlich der Psychologie waren anerkannt."},{"kind":"text","t":48392.539326,"text":"Aristotle’s views on all scientific matters, including psychology, were recognized."},{"kind":"audio","t":48435.223714,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":48436.810315999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":48438.480429999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":48440.078082,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":48441.261545999994,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":520},{"kind":"input","t":57712.786520999995,"text":"Wenn Sie es nicht gewohnt sind, auf Landstraßen zu fahren, bleiben Sie achtsam. Steiles Gefälle, enge Fahrbahnen und scharfe Kurven überwiegen hier."},{"kind":"text","t":57966.077699999994,"text":"If you’re not used to driving on country roads, stay cautious. Steep slopes, narrow roads, and sharp turns predominate here."},{"kind":"audio","t":58006.835569999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58008.398051,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":58010.005682999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":58010.159726,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":58046.746850999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58048.412525,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58050.044127999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":58050.180649999995,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":69989.133503,"text":"Die Gegenwart eines echten, unsichtbaren Teams, Larson und Lafasto, 1989, Seite 109."},{"kind":"text","t":70377.934716,"text":"The presence of a real, invisible team, Larson and Lafasto, 1989, page 109."},{"kind":"audio","t":70424.004611,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70425.586733,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":70427.155825,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":340,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70428.784767,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70430.629304,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70431.803158,"samples":29360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":72310.006367,"text":"ist auch ein einzigartiger Bestandteil eines virtuellen Teams."},{"kind":"text","t":72496.627727,"text":"It is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"audio","t":72534.770363,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72536.377396,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72537.87282599999,"samples":32264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"input","t":81100.350735,"text":"Nach dem Unfall wurde Gibson in ein Krankenhaus gebracht."},{"kind":"text","t":81283.864562,"text":"After the accident, Gibson was taken to a hospital."},{"kind":"audio","t":81323.408547,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":81324.816615,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":330,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81326.437147,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":81326.55576999999,"samples":2496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":85089.718824,"text":"Er verstarb jedoch kurz darauf."},{"kind":"text","t":85204.010031,"text":"He passed away shortly after."},{"kind":"audio","t":85240.728059,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85242.068466,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":810},{"kind":"audio","t":85242.192688,"samples":464,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":90137.389599,"text":"Viele deutsche Backwaren beinhalten außerdem Mandeln, Haselnüsse oder andere Nüsse."},{"kind":"text","t":90389.719289,"text":"Many German baked goods also contain almonds, hazelnuts, or other nuts."},{"kind":"audio","t":90431.381056,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90432.933247,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90434.522569,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90436.226394,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":90436.324395,"samples":3928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":95231.70499,"text":"Beliebte Kuchen passen häufig besonders gut zu einer Tasse starken Kaffees."},{"kind":"text","t":95442.294052,"text":"Popular cakes often pair especially well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"audio","t":95482.882687,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":95484.450339,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95486.107372,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95487.347817,"samples":27696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":100342.529864,"text":"Wenn man eine romanische Sprache spricht, ist es natürlich leichter, Portugiesisch zu erlernen."},{"kind":"text","t":100580.944544,"text":"If you speak a Romance language, it’s naturally easier to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"audio","t":100624.405137,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100625.900018,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100627.566801,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100629.209754,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":100629.310786,"samples":2128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":107855.073886,"text":"Die Klang- und Lichtshow bei den Pyramiden ist eine der interessantesten Attraktionen für Kinder in der Gegend."},{"kind":"text","t":108187.359742,"text":"The sound and light show at the pyramids is one of the most interesting attractions for children in the area."},{"kind":"audio","t":108233.192803,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108234.951159,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108236.319986,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":108238.02602,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":108239.637063,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":108239.938349,"samples":11960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":118499.13698,"text":"Verkehrsfluss ist die Untersuchung der Bewegung einzelner Fahrer und Fahrzeuge zwischen zwei Punkten und der Interaktionen, die zwischen beiden stattfinden."},{"kind":"text","t":118860.33714799999,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points and the interactions that occur between them."},{"kind":"audio","t":118908.347633,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":118909.923264,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118911.595968,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118913.19614,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118914.818723,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":118916.508457,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118918.29762299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":118918.399525,"samples":4024,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":129037.139364,"text":"der australier mitchell gurley wurde elfter im stehenden super g der männer der tschechische konkurrent aldrich jelinek wurde sechzehnter im sitzenden super g der männer"},{"kind":"text","t":129548.415807,"text":"Australian Mitchell Gurley finished eleventh in the men’s standing Super G, while Czech competitor Aldrich Jelinek came in sixteenth in the men’s sitting Super G."},{"kind":"audio","t":129599.11923599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129600.714338,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129602.23953899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129603.878082,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129605.562475,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129607.245859,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129608.86904199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129609.829361,"samples":23824,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":139515.760654,"text":"Das Haitianische Institut für Gerechtigkeit und Demokratie hat auf unabhängigen Studien verwiesen, die nahelegen, dass das nepalesische UN-Friedensbataillon die Krankheit unwissentlich"},{"kind":"text","t":139907.177899,"text":"The Haitian Institute for Justice and Democracy cited independent studies suggesting that the Nepalese UN peacekeeping battalion spread the disease unintentionally"},{"kind":"audio","t":139957.826287,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139959.376678,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139960.96594000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139962.640443,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":139964.37089800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":139966.05322200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139967.70811500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139969.41719,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139970.46936100002,"samples":26456,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"input","t":142082.211343,"text":"nach Haiti eingeschleppt hat."},{"kind":"text","t":142186.19114200003,"text":"introduced to Haiti."},{"kind":"audio","t":142222.49238100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142222.773787,"samples":18832,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":240},{"kind":"input","t":148144.94967300002,"text":"Bald nach dem Ausbruch von Kampfhandlungen initiierte Großbritannien eine Seeblockade gegen Deutschland."},{"kind":"text","t":148398.23919300002,"text":"Shortly after the outbreak of hostilities, Britain imposed a naval blockade on Germany."},{"kind":"audio","t":148441.014712,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148442.57616300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":148444.153735,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148445.87249,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148447.047273,"samples":26128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":155377.67611200002,"text":"Er griff auch alles an, was ins Wasser kam. Selbst ein großer Dinosaurier wie der T-Rex war ihm nicht gewachsen."},{"kind":"text","t":155670.764142,"text":"He also attacked anything that entered the water. Even a giant dinosaur like the T-Rex was no match for him."},{"kind":"audio","t":155710.52198000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":155712.13673300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155712.90991800002,"samples":20864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":270},{"kind":"audio","t":155744.61832500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155746.39563100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155748.034324,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155748.81541,"samples":19296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":190},{"kind":"input","t":167440.436013,"text":"Die Verwendung von Videoaufzeichnungen führte zu wichtigen Erkenntnissen für die Deutung von Mikroexpressionen, wenige Millisekunden dauernden Gesichtsbewegungen."},{"kind":"text","t":167803.74208300002,"text":"The use of video recordings led to important insights for interpreting microexpressions, facial movements that last just a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"audio","t":167853.065674,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167854.703507,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167856.35822000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167858.04770400003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167859.692547,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167861.403782,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167863.084066,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167863.68287800002,"samples":15424,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":175063.60306800003,"text":"Die Ankündigung erfolgte nach einem Telefongespräch von Trump mit dem türkischen Präsidenten Recep Tayyip."},{"kind":"text","t":175344.514842,"text":"The announcement came after a phone call between Trump and Turkish President Recep Tayyip."},{"kind":"audio","t":175387.84936300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175389.43478500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175391.04030700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175392.592198,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175393.311473,"samples":18928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":100},{"kind":"input","t":176674.494826,"text":"Ja, Dugan."},{"kind":"text","t":176791.212151,"text":"Yes, Dugan."},{"kind":"audio","t":176826.34829700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":176826.50352,"samples":9832,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":185586.278373,"text":"Es gibt Familienstrände, die manchmal überlaufen sind, mit einer schönen Einkaufspromenade entlang der Küste. Das Schwimmen ist hier sicher."},{"kind":"text","t":185958.52831300002,"text":"There are family beaches that can be crowded at times, with a nice promenade along the coast. Swimming is safe here."},{"kind":"audio","t":186003.01046700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":186004.71902100003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":186006.30765300003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":186007.99049700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":186008.878884,"samples":21928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"audio","t":186032.53409,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":186032.895617,"samples":17032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":180},{"kind":"input","t":196884.94571,"text":"Die meisten der kleineren Inseln sind unabhängige Nationen oder zu Frankreich gehörig und als luxuriöse Seebäder"},{"kind":"text","t":197178.110301,"text":"Most of the smaller islands are independent nations or part of France and serve as luxurious seaside resorts."},{"kind":"audio","t":197213.849269,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":197215.437941,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":197217.020193,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":197218.676836,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":197220.35545,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":197221.79638900002,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"input","t":198563.62358100002,"text":"Bekannt."},{"kind":"text","t":198639.18866900002,"text":"Famous."},{"kind":"audio","t":198673.63192100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1030},{"kind":"audio","t":198673.75665400003,"samples":3232,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":208705.118397,"code":1005}]}